    "Comments": "Even without the mysterious context and Silence of the Lambs cultural association attached to it (I don't really think that movie's use of this song did it justice anyway tbh), this song already possesses a singular atmosphere, occupying that oft-ignored transient space between life and death. Surrounded by progressively dimming lights and faceless ghosts, the narrator slowly sheds all of their earthly belongings as they move on into the next world. I don't think I can truly get this song until the day my hours are numbered",
