    "Comments": "A perfect encapsulation of that undercurrent of malaise that's been plaguing reality since the decade began, deftly covering issues of identity, inequality, activism, nostalgia & lost time, friendship, and burnout in the most cathartic way possible. Rosenstock taking his entire ethos and packing it into one last series finale-esque blaze of a song (though thankfully without actually being a series finale)",
